### Test 1: Get Event History - One unit
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/getEventHistory
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": 12,
  "unitId": 5001,
  "startDate": "2026-10-01T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-10-07T23:59:59"
}

### Test 2: Get Event History - All units
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/getEventHistory
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": 12,
  "startDate": "2026-10-06T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-10-07T23:59:59"
}

### Test 3: Get Event History - Invalid (range)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/getEventHistory
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": 12,
  "startDate": "2026-08-01T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-10-07T23:59:59"
